    "created_at": "2016-08-04T17:07:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-04T17:07:41Z",
    "body": "Unless we tie OCSP to a controlled client it won't go through service worker.  Since this is done in the browser at down in the TLS stack, it seems unlikely it actually has a client.\n",
