    "created_at": "2016-08-04T17:45:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-04T17:45:43Z",
    "body": "Navigations will have a client per what we have agreed to in the spec.\n\nI think reports will only get intercepted if triggered from a controlled client context.  So they should have a client as well.  (Otherwise I don't understand how we pick the service worker for them...)\n",
